    "segments": [
      {
        "role": "tutor",
        "speaker": "Tutor",
        "sourceStart": 7,
        "sourceEnd": 174,
        "text": "Good morning, Mei. Thanks for coming to this week 36 review. Let's check your academic task progress and your transition plan. First, how did the literature review go?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "c96dd029abf30a8a10ee714ad879087584580c15d94fded580a3a64315abf21c",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0
      },
      {
        "role": "mei",
        "speaker": "Mei",
        "sourceStart": 180,
        "sourceEnd": 346,
        "text": "It went better than last time. I finished the first draft on Tuesday, but I'm still checking the citations. I found three sources that I hadn't read carefully before.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "064843930763910556c7c4616a23ad5a334dde314e21907bd0c6f6d95f3e32d6",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "tutor",
        "speaker": "Tutor",
        "sourceStart": 354,
        "sourceEnd": 390,
        "text": "Good. And the data analysis section?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "1656bf8b0eac1d720992809c142a6ced7fc5216b3d10a21ca4d85aad288f43cd",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "mei",
        "speaker": "Mei",
        "sourceStart": 396,
        "sourceEnd": 534,
        "text": "That's the part I'm worried about. I ran the numbers twice, but my supervisor said the sample size is too small to support a strong claim.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "92fa53abcc2d85872e508602e5833376afbca5ae557824c9b78edab497e73f2b",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "tutor",
        "speaker": "Tutor",
        "sourceStart": 542,
        "sourceEnd": 580,
        "text": "Right. So what will you do about that?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "65b2b0d01ab039a3be41670eae0f6052bc1fdf97c62b215098f0f33d656f9aca",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "mei",
        "speaker": "Mei",
        "sourceStart": 586,
        "sourceEnd": 714,
        "text": "I'll add a limitations paragraph and explain that the results are preliminary. I won't change the data, just the interpretation.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "db17ae06c2383a980eed95f5242d2dbb0f91023dedccd24011b512e3e81e05a4",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "tutor",
        "speaker": "Tutor",
        "sourceStart": 722,
        "sourceEnd": 828,
        "text": "That's a sensible approach. Now, about your transition to the dissertation stage. Have you chosen a topic?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "071d64af587ff088c1a4d9e3989da4e258949f89fd5ce5e216b8b49f809631cf",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "mei",
        "speaker": "Mei",
        "sourceStart": 834,
        "sourceEnd": 998,
        "text": "Not yet. I have two possible topics, but I need to discuss them with my supervisor next week. One is about online learning, and the other is about teacher feedback.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "4b1446b1d037e8930ea7a6daae8433ac0e603f76f99280e0229ce8e0f2be2d9c",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "tutor",
        "speaker": "Tutor",
        "sourceStart": 1006,
        "sourceEnd": 1030,
        "text": "Which one do you prefer?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "fe5ecf15a6020f7ce0f0f52f6a1af2ba2768457e8d0328a7184071a98ab2427a",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "mei",
        "speaker": "Mei",
        "sourceStart": 1036,
        "sourceEnd": 1142,
        "text": "I think the teacher feedback topic is more practical, but the online learning one has more available data.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "326af1b61f57baf44c08a704733baa7f35dd7101c281f503f4bc7b53db53d7ed",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "tutor",
        "speaker": "Tutor",
        "sourceStart": 1150,
        "sourceEnd": 1239,
        "text": "You could combine them—teacher feedback in online courses. That might be original enough.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "9310c311b940292f92455da72ed851458a9a3960dcbf1b4c3fac9c189424f80a",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "mei",
        "speaker": "Mei",
        "sourceStart": 1245,
        "sourceEnd": 1290,
        "text": "That's a good idea. I hadn't thought of that.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "613ce7f3a72a134656be775625d424a20a00ab292175be283d1b404afbd26be2",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "tutor",
        "speaker": "Tutor",
        "sourceStart": 1298,
        "sourceEnd": 1491,
        "text": "Let's look at your grammar check from last week. You had some issues with tense consistency and subject-verb agreement. For example, you wrote 'The results shows' instead of 'The results show'.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "e515ddfbb77b13ad8f1fc9ca972153c7633562a2ae503a927c1b9a8654d2dd62",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "mei",
        "speaker": "Mei",
        "sourceStart": 1497,
        "sourceEnd": 1586,
        "text": "Yes, I noticed that. I also have trouble with articles—when to use 'the' and when not to.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "ff17d14d123af0d9ac7bf04575d5068c8fd064b2b2b8c6d46afd03b939c9f7fa",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "tutor",
        "speaker": "Tutor",
        "sourceStart": 1594,
        "sourceEnd": 1800,
        "text": "We'll review those in your self-correction log. Also, check your use of clauses. In one sentence you wrote 'Although the sample was small, but the results were clear.' You don't need 'but' after 'although'.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "29005dd59770ffb4870d8b5bd3d1870730f5a1286d8e8f9ab0ecfed192acd00e",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "mei",
        "speaker": "Mei",
        "sourceStart": 1806,
        "sourceEnd": 1827,
        "text": "Right. I'll fix that.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "6566303a33ed2368b0eed37d88912007ce87f1e3d9158c3b0588a53a2d107c11",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "tutor",
        "speaker": "Tutor",
        "sourceStart": 1835,
        "sourceEnd": 1937,
        "text": "Finally, your transition check: you need to submit a one-page proposal by Friday. Have you started it?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "31d0d982bd74b20a2d86168afa039db04b87fe86ae7f1800251ebc91d5a6628b",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "mei",
        "speaker": "Mei",
        "sourceStart": 1943,
        "sourceEnd": 2043,
        "text": "I've written the introduction and the research questions, but I haven't written the methodology yet.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "82926a9b907b86d5174d24aa629ed45613b478b9fd86138e6c1e78314714213c",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "tutor",
        "speaker": "Tutor",
        "sourceStart": 2051,
        "sourceEnd": 2146,
        "text": "Okay. Focus on that today. And remember, the proposal is due at 5 p.m. on Friday, not Thursday.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "0c710be419e823242b52fe22776565b89485d06190ec97911f9bbeadd6f0c4bd",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "mei",
        "speaker": "Mei",
        "sourceStart": 2152,
        "sourceEnd": 2208,
        "text": "Thanks for the reminder. I'll send you a draft tomorrow.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "b5a1fcdd8a818d3294f54ae50323d7bb858d99f785b3df280b506d3aadf37a69",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      }
    ]
  },
